      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIPPED RACCOON (6) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to finish fifth over 320m at Richmond (18.60) latest in a Mix 1/2/3. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won 11 of 15 tries. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Key runner on his best form. AWESOME RETURN (2) was a Mix 2/3 winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 2 this time where he has performed well. Well placed here and should do much better. SHE'S SILKY (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th over 300m at this track beaten 6 lengths (17.48) behind Kingsbrae Ted in a Free For All on November 14. Can hit the frame with the right run. BOMB NOAH (8) will have admirers again after placing from the same draw last time out.",
